{"en": "278888457", "title": "PARTIE 11 : ÉVÉNEMENTS NON CONFORMES", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "extensionType": "com.atlassian.confluence.macro.core", "extensionKey": "toc", "parameters": {"macroParams": {"style": {"value": "none"}}, "macroMetadata": {"macroId": {"value": "fb8bbc29-7549-40b5-ae03-1125f267a2ab"}, "schemaVersion": {"value": "1"}, "title": "Table of Contents"}}, "localId": "5103d9fd-91e0-4e79-ba11-8f450c1800b6"}}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un événement non conforme (ENC), ou non-conformité, se définit comme le non-respect d'une exigence. Un ENC survient lorsqu'il y a un écart par rapport aux politiques et procédures établies. Au laboratoire, les ENC peuvent par exemple être :"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Échantillons non étiquetés ou mal étiquetés"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Échantillons manquants"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Erreurs de préparation des échantillons"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Retards dans le délai de rendu des résultats"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rapports remis au mauvais destinataire"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rapports corrigés"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour l'assurance qualité au laboratoire, il est essentiel que le personnel et les responsables enregistrent tous les ENC et leur suivi. "}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La gestion des événements non conformes comporte quatre étapes, décrites dans les guides suivants :"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Signaler un ENC"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Créer un plan d'actions correctives"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Suivre le plan d'actions correctives"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Clôturer un rapport d'ENC"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comment signaler un événement non conforme (ENC)", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Placez le pointeur de la souris sur l'icône du menu (hamburger) et cliquez pour ouvrir le menu."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfidtIENzm1FvhoUxWPYppIsUlX8MCe8bpz5gRKS8aAMiXCMQ4G1O2-I2gZlQspK7ItwDwB60zdijulwu5LTu_nG0mMZHFc4QKryffQIrmTsd08h9KQRGqiK0mUq8C0XXtghQQbmAGSr5-ZMIE8DP6cOsc?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 680}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Accéder au menu d'OpenELIS", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Placez le pointeur de la souris sur le module "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Non Conform", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et cliquez sur son menu déroulant."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc7hv-fZXHGnCgKIPp1kQU8TO7H2NUSQ3IQTpVeIZ-1Omu14JIgo9rWmRjUjmua3lzEH8SpfhRnu9ufZnbN_52-RMiTrlTbjHlnQk7Bon2SsF7mzV12yiDfk8kuyQb_KKTttDrKg-z3ajvZYaSsn3GKt6-X?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 369}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur le menu déroulant Non-Conform", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": " ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur l'élément de sous-menu "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Signaler un Événement Non Conforme", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Report Non-Conforming Event", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcSOmJM42enFGZgqTfa7ruW8jifOznASPJ4tnDGz2SZ5nU3byTNfRhdOUi0gkB-kActOhyJLRSDtXJiO1dS6bAFY5xV9g5JIKD1KcdTJx8hUrZtApxcJMmg3fMdxy2aIpG7XEbZxyN9KE37XvzLFU4DMvtV?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 357}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur le sous-menu Signaler un Événement Non Conforme", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 4}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Placez le pointeur de la souris sur l'onglet Non-Conforming Events et sélectionnez Signaler un Événement Non Conforme."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeEjPlThwYFFhXlhetk9i90JPEh_Z2bs2hyP21bcMV0cieg98qIg18KOH8Vhuabm1PST-wSUl-cYqyiCbEomt8MsQVewLikDKTyYHwd9eNPOvb0V0xE-SXp5Y_PHn4XQs5vbcHEpbDME1bDFUD1OCOtO-42?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 401}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur le sous-menu Signaler un Événement Non Conforme", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 5}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Recherchez le numéro de laboratoire associé à l'événement non conforme : choisissez votre critère de recherche dans le menu déroulant et saisissez le numéro ou le nom dans le champ de recherche. Cliquez ensuite sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rechercher", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Search", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfKhU9Xw5boAh7aPLycd8HMVAmy0hhn0G3zJLUBiyEJoxOJjejSwgo9rDYAhAyO0cGupALet95SnHVCiu3hKFEtU7cZlYGZ6ph-14A0zasvdR8MLkkkyF_Xn8MwWnWtO9qjgSJ2NtZf3PII7m-hejuvLq_U?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 360}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rechercher par numéro de laboratoire", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 6}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La demande et ses échantillons s'affichent. Cochez la case à côté de l'échantillon concerné par l'ENC. Si l'ENC n'est pas lié à un échantillon précis, cochez tous les échantillons. Cliquez sur le bouton "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Accéder au formulaire de signalement NCE", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Go to NCE Reporting Form", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). "}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdDxIdsKqpAvW_bk4J9i0ledxYcayYw1DigHT2PvSk9mCELUspNwofOmURGlPZjz0ODaKdHZSkK149YuicwyuXOGJspriE_cTIRjyxQlq_Z70zbWhMG99y1FkSyrrTkuHpN-FYgq3GelBfh7l_jJCwQCVPP?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 408}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cocher l'échantillon concerné et cliquer sur Accéder au formulaire de signalement NCE ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 7}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Vérifiez les informations affichées automatiquement : date du rapport d'ENC (qui doit être la date du jour), nom, numéro de demande du laboratoire et numéro d'échantillon. "}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": " Si nécessaire, renseignez le nom de la personne qui signale, s'il est différent. "}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarque : ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "le nom correspond à la personne qui remplit ce formulaire. Le membre du personnel qui remplit le formulaire de signalement d'ENC n'est pas forcément la personne qui a constaté l'ENC et l'a signalé. Utilisez le champ du nom de la personne qui signale (si différent) pour la personne qui a constaté l'ENC en premier. OpenELIS attribue automatiquement un numéro d'ENC au rapport."}, {"type": "text", "text": " ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 9}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Renseignez la date de l'ENC (elle peut être différente de la date du rapport). "}, {"type": "text", "text": " ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcYEqCToa4QYY-IJvf2Y1gpZMgWaYUzDwKQMOgd6JBCpkzAAzcqkwbGzf3SOV2yCRAOMRv_HeRlH88QkvrwZITrbeVfFWCWuviTqaLEOZsooLb4ZB4B09YP6ctMwbWDXGNUKipiR6tW9IIr5csn3QBBT0jG?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 428}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Renseigner le nom de la personne qui signale et la date", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 10}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sélectionnez l'unité qui signale."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisissez une description de l'ENC."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisissez la cause présumée de l'ENC."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisissez l'action proposée. "}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur le bouton "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Soumettre", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Submit", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). "}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc9GaDt9xxY7dkcyz16_ONfmDBwd2xPmJL4OJjOSK--OpUHqKwx7OTm1-pJHw_iw-pUB5XftNSQslEnzwXt1ashxFpBqs0BbaJQfWrMmtKNpWWgPrpZOshhkuZaZFVbxw-TVcUZfYmtkfnbh-Y69UM7X6uW?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 445}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remplir les champs du formulaire et cliquer sur Soumettre", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Un message indique que le formulaire a été enregistré. "}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcybBHscg24Sps-vSDO-dgX-Rajefav0oQXeRHDyx4WJA3cIDDrq0HYsgqlGV5iyplggSWxneOKPuCAZxyuCxXuxuZVf4tg5xnOrneUGrk9iUT6pWox6cZT168H6MnY16UZSXYcVuFU3y1iyJnEH1S-v28h?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 285}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Enregistrement réussi", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comment créer un plan d'actions correctives pour un ENC", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Une fois le formulaire de signalement d'ENC rempli, l'étape suivante consiste à remplir le formulaire de suivi de l'ENC. Cela peut se faire plus tard, selon les procédures du laboratoire."}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sélectionnez View New Non-Conforming Event dans le menu du module Non-Conforming"}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdA0xJ1Nw6OgpZX5cvXtut_M2WpM-WnQZd1N4L9OYjqf-jT_5JEsk9s8tCsK37v9OyH-hBqHhyCc8y1QnPCsFtrFObhOLzaw-5o6h9yFOu-65pObsz3J8aBMIfo9GI0a-ybFn4t2CbplJsl1-NwLKeB-w0h?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 419}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#091e4224"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "View New Non Conforming Event", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Placez le pointeur de la souris sur l'onglet Non-Conforming Events et sélectionnez View New Non-Conforming Event."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfYIZr1BJ9GhEldKGHFeZDlvp0lxIyFFEXDDQwxmWm8uXCRplV4rtyMM5U_T1GaLZvYUXJufuD-IYZmxdZpvN5mLRhFNGf-yqKq241BNb7XpPuxgt7-50Q-MfsHFvk70hS4ZdtxjzqucYDvJygr81mRHMfM?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 393}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur View Non-Conforming Events", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Choisissez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Numéro laboratoire", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Lab Number", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") ou "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Numéro d'ENC", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "NCE Number", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") comme critère de recherche et saisissez le numéro dans le champ de recherche. Cliquez sur le bouton "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rechercher ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Dans cet exemple, le numéro de laboratoire saisi est DEV12300000000000126."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeytTGu2OI2S6tqX8PaD9UHiN_6a6F1ae9jmHE512XdI9mhB84wj7R0JnB74376WY56sCcL1wPQ6PnEMo47kmce-vLCIcbOuEG9AkDrln8QPDQc_8yi-a2ig1vWANnpYIfnmW--ltSBgy78oxPjVmRbDAaq?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 305}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarque : le formulaire de suivi de l'ENC comporte deux parties : la section de description de l'ENC et le plan d'actions correctives. "}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Formulaire de suivi de l'ENC : partie 1, description de l'ENC", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Vérifiez les informations de l'ENC dans le formulaire. Remplissez les autres éléments du formulaire à l'aide des listes déroulantes. "}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcgFGgkpp2zjbARHtet_601J8lA0xgSW13qKOD4IxPrmNHYiPOkoufsvdzPuQBVgc9GTRSKYzSWtP_Am3WT2DQkOjVlY7PM-X8RpaVue-ITndiYuN_3RTlKawX_kCZwrGOQmccJSbP9GqotjcI0Uoc6rPw?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 367}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "